{"server":"cn","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_02_beg","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_02","title":"生命运河","storyCode":"HE-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"df8032cd8f9b7c1f1b720780e27a7b5a4a3563a134ee005f9eb6e30f742a787e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g2_abandonsancturay"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一个很远很远的地方，有一个小村庄，那里生活着一群幸福的村民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们中的一些人为大家建起遮风避雨的小屋，并开垦出农田。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一些人则外出打猎，寻找矿石，顺便还打跑那些想要将村子占为己有的坏蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些村民不分你我，谁都离不开谁，他们共同生活在小小的村庄中，都认为这里是自己的家园。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是好景不长，农田里的作物逐渐减产，打猎也越来越艰难，可以吃的食物越来越少，大家都饿得肚子咕咕叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天气也变得越来越冷，可是能用来取暖的燃料却怎么也不够分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可怎么办才好呀！大家都说，“这一定是主给予我们的磨练，我们必须祈求宽恕！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这时候，一群好心人来到这里，见到村庄中的情况，就同领头的村民说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“来吧，你们可以来我们的城市生活。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“但是，我们只能带走你们之中和我们更相似的那一部分人。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“来吧，来过更好的生活，只要抛下你们之中的一小部分人就可以了......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗姐姐，不要讲这个故事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你们不喜欢这个故事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不喜欢！饿肚子，会很难受......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很难受。而且，不可以丢下其他人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实是很“正确”的集体主义观念，或许还带有英雄主义......甚至浪漫主义的色彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"浪漫的故事自然有其动人之处，只是，浪漫与傲慢有时也会迷惑他人，以及我们自身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好难，听不懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔图罗姐姐又说奇怪的话了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，对不起，是姐姐不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们换一个故事。你们想听什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想听......英雄的故事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想当大英雄吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子&活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当大英雄！和妈妈一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好厉害，你们的妈妈真了不起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好孩子们，稍微等我一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像来得不是时候。打扰到你了吗，阿尔图罗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明知故问，奥卢斯阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你原谅。无意惹你不快，我是来向你辞行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为多了一位计划外的旅伴，我准备尽快启程，护送我的同胞回到家乡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会为这位可悲的人稍作祈祷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我无意在这里与你争执......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尤其是在这两个孩子面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，任何与生命相关的决心都不应用“可悲”来形容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"决心......决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们对自己的控制，往往并没有我们自己想的那样完美无缺，在事情真正发生之前，谁也无法断言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想着绝不能做的事，有时回过神来，就已经那么去做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"责怪行动偏离内心吗？可又有谁能断言，我们自以为的决心，不是自己用来说服自己的某种谎言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的时候，我们最真实的情感与意图究竟藏在何处......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们的思想、情感、行动，什么时候才会有真正统一的一天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不正是你的疑问吗，阁下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_941_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天似乎是会发生很多事情的一天，我听到外面很吵闹，像是有我认识的客人上门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是你，奥卢斯阁下，在如今这样的时刻就不会急着离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"久等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐好慢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_929_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好慢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原谅我吧。作为赔礼，我再给你们讲一个特别精彩的故事，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想听英雄大战坏蛋的故事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害羞的孩子&活泼的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_928_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那你们要好好地听哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_490_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很久很久以前，在一座城堡里，住着一个没什么表情，也不爱说话，但是打起架来十分凶狠的小男孩......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是个猎户这样的说法无法让你接受，那换一种也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是个普通的，有点上了年纪的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不认为这是全部事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你随身带着武器，就在身后。你在行动中有意遮掩，这是雇佣兵的习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......防身罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们之前也看到了，那些强盗时不时就会前来骚扰，这里并不是一直都那么太平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有就雇佣兵的习惯给出解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你看到的这双手，握着农具的时间比握着武器的时间要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里靠打猎为生，我会下田种地，有必要时也充当矿工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是一双值得你警惕的双手。我只是个为生活所困的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，想想我们的首要任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为现在不是追究一个可能性的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......合理的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在可以说明一下情况了吗，主教阁下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，斯特凡诺。给你添麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，你没有需要道歉之处，杰拉尔德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像两位看到的这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在十余年前，杰拉尔德带着一小群萨卡兹来到修道院附近，他们那时候已经弹尽粮绝，在荒野上迷失了方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在发现修道院之后，尝试与我们接触几乎是他们唯一的选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们并未驱逐他们，于是他们选择在此定居。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驱逐一群走投无路的人，与把他们逼上绝路有何区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那倒也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起初，并非所有人都能够接受这样的一群邻居。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那些无根的仇恨与隔阂，在生活面前实在不值一提......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们为这些人提供一处安身之所，他们反过来帮助我们处理那些我们亟待解决的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短缺的食物、来自强盗的威胁，还有逐渐耗尽的能源......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们依靠我们，我们也依赖他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们还是选择派出信使联系拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是别无选择的选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰愿意为我们提供援助，也愿意接纳我们回归拉特兰本土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，就算是愿意给出最大程度让步的蕾缪安特使，也提出了一个绝不容动摇的条件——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“乐园不容萨卡兹。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为何不容？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只因种族？只因他们是萨卡兹？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们与我们有什么不同？如果没有这些善战的兄弟姐妹，我们早就难以为继！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我们相互扶持着活下去的那些岁月里，拉特兰又在哪里？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这里再一次恳求两位......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我恳求智慧的教宗阁下，我恳求你我的信仰......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"枯瘦的老人抬起双手。\n好似要将信仰高举，又好似已不堪重负，摇摇欲坠。\n萨科塔的信仰无形无迹，无处可寻。\n手指徒劳地抓过头顶的光环，老人的手逐渐滑落，覆住自己的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安并没有说错。拉特兰不会有萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰城也不允许萨卡兹进入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，费德里科，有点太直白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经够了，斯特凡诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特凡诺，我说过，我们可以接受那个条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们去拉特兰，我们找个地方重新开始。那个叫蕾缪安的特使也答应给我们一定的支援，只是名义上我们......必须分割罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这本来也是事实，他们能提出这种条件已经超出我的预料，已经足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这不该是事实！也绝不足够！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道不明白？正因这可笑的名义上的分割，我才越发感到荒谬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，斯特凡诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们放弃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是，如果你是因为我们，才把自己逼到这个地步，那实在没有这个必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要对你自己这么苛刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经问过大家的意见。我们决定......离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就没有问题了吧，执行者阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们离开。只是放过一群朝不保夕的流民，这样可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公证所并不会将无罪名的平民列为攻击对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的吗，费德里科？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不说谎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......该怎么说......唉，算了，你是领队，你判断没问题的话，我也没意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以向你们保证，拉特兰的圣堂内从来没有出现过任何一个萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这并不构成任何罪名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么说呢，这确实不是什么明文禁令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特凡诺·托雷格罗萨主教，根据你的供述，我将继续追查奥伦·亚吉奥拉斯的去向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是否可以认为你已确认接受拉特兰方提出的条件，同意修道院内除萨卡兹以外的居民择日转移前往拉特兰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如继续沉默，是否可以解读为你已默认同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯特凡诺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一点时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望能够在这里完成最后一次布道，再度过最后一个夜晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请你们......最后再给这里一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天的晨会之后，我会给你们一个答复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得呢，费德里科？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我希望见到枢机辅佐官蕾缪安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安特使是我们的客人，你们想见的话，自然可以去见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凯莱","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么两位，我们先告辞......哎，等等，费德里科，你好歹打声招呼......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还保留着雇佣兵的习惯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年了，有些习惯看来还是改不掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉尔德，你真的确定了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，斯特凡诺。你知道我不会拿这种事开玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们所有人都为生活所困。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实不是谎言。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g4_gatheringplace_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在吗？我来送冬衣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，奇怪了，今天怎么到哪都找不到人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小菲娜？你傻站在这干啥呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，卡洛琳！你来得正好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来给大家送点冬天穿的厚衣服，今天怎么回事？我走了半天一个人都没遇上......你们都忙什么去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡洛琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......今天都有点事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡洛琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你特地跑一趟，但是这些衣服，呃，我们过冬的衣服其实够穿了，小菲娜你还是拿回去吧。也告诉其他人，不用替我们操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么傻话啊？最近几年哪一年过冬我们东西是足够的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡洛琳你不是到现在都还穿着那件薄外套吗？很快就要大降温了，总该给你准备件更厚实点的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡洛琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小菲娜？你怎么了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡洛琳，你手上拿着的那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡洛琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......没什么。就是点干粮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，你让我看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡洛琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......等一下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨科塔女孩伸手夺过对方藏在身后的所谓的干粮，她几乎是凭借直觉，在被阻止前将那又干又硬的东西从中间掰开。\n填充在干粮内部，某些一直被隐藏起来的真相，就此暴露在她的眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糠皮？还有......这是木屑？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡洛琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡洛琳？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是和我说你们不缺吃的......不缺，你们就吃这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡洛琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，小菲娜，你听我说。我们、我们只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我吧，卡洛琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我吧......我们这日子，到底已经过到什么样的地步了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"咚。\n咚。咚咚。咚咚咚。\n门被敲响了。\n门其实并没有锁。但门外的客人在得到回应前，依然只是敲门。\n这是曾经在学校里，几个好友之间约定过的暗语。时间过去太久，蕾缪安原以为自己已经忘记，但事实证明，她并没有忘。\n客人敲击出的暗语的含义是：\n“解救成功。”\n以及：“第一个到达。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请进。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，客房服务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢，餐品请放在桌上就好。需要小费吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有问别人要不要小费的，这种事不都是看心意给的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，说得也是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像一点也不惊讶，蕾缪安学姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到是我会失望吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会来，就证明这边的消息已经传回拉特兰了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？嗯......差不多吧。奥伦那家伙竟然把学姐你一个人丢在这，我回头就把这事告诉莫斯提马和菲亚梅塔她们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈，还是放过他吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没意思——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，言归正传。教宗阁下不会安排你一个人来这里，这点我还是可以确定的。那么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你汇报你的任务，以及队伍构成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变成公事公办的口吻了，好吧，蕾缪安枢机辅佐官阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本次任务由教宗阁下直接派遣，由公证所执行者费德里科带队，成员有同是执行者的里凯莱·科伦波，以及主动申请加入的本人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们接到的首要任务是找到你和奥伦，次要任务是调查这座修道院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦对了，费德里科还有个维稳的任务，我觉得教宗阁下这次真是找错人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汇报完毕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......原来如此，教宗阁下竟然派了那个费德里科来吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况我大致了解了。辛苦了，莉雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，这时候又喊名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以学姐接下来打算怎么办？你看起来像是被限制了行动，不过实际上只是你本人不愿意走吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你想走，这里的人可拦不住你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿还没好全呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太相信我了哦，莉雅，虽然也可以啦......好吧，确实是我主动留下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果费德里科要以非法拘禁之类的罪名逮捕这里的主教阁下的话，就麻烦你帮我和他澄清一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，抱歉，我暂时......还不打算离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能问问理由吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理由......嗯，因为外交并不是那种只靠铳和子弹就能解决的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"论射击的话我是随时都有胜算啦，但如果坐下来协商谈判，说不好就是对方说服我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好我和这里的居民还挺聊得来的，我也想看看，最后改变想法的会是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，说得好像学姐真的会让步一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"读书的时候学姐可是蹲守了我一整个学年，就为了抓我去学校上课欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，我只是觉得如果莉雅因为逃课拿不到毕业证书的话，就太可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于这里的问题......至少我现在态度还很友好哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道奥伦一定会把这里的情况汇报回去，所以我选择留下。我不想再刺激主教阁下，我总有种不太好的感觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在掌握了这么多修道院的情报后，如果有机会再谈判一次，或许我能够让主教阁下的态度缓和一点，接受我的方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我就猜到会是这种理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能理解那真是太好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没这么说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我知道你是这么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有点讨厌共感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说，你对这里的情况了解多少了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除去有一群萨卡兹以外，没什么特别出奇的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，他们一共派出了三位信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莉雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你并不喜欢出外勤任务，你为什么会主动申请？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就不能是为了学姐才来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说谎~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之我先去和费德里科他们会合，把你这里的情况告诉他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过说实话，我不觉得你的努力真的能有什么效果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总要再试试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g10_monasterycorridor_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，蕾缪安学姐越来越可怕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过也无所谓......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于有工夫和我联络了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你见了蕾缪安一面，就要放弃你的任务了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道呢，搞不好哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......别开玩笑了，饶了我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可是你自己先说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，我没时间和你废话，说点正事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......应付这种人真累人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好麻烦的任务，啧，早知道就不接了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什么人在那里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你居然真的跟过来了啊，小妹妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不能放你一个人在修道院里乱跑！我得监督你不会做什么坏事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，我有一件事想拜托你......我会准备好报酬的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g9_monasteryroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，让我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面粉，蛋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，还有......上次剩下来的那点糖被我放哪了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，明明每天都有努力节省晚饭的食材了，怎么还是只有这么一点啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要给斯普莉雅的，给斯特凡诺爷爷的，给菲娜和莱蒙德......还有杰拉尔德叔叔，克莱芒叔叔，卡洛琳姐，还有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么分都不够嘛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小福？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我进来了哦？有点事想和你说......你这是在干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，菲娜！你来得正好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得之前我帮妮娜婶婶干了一个月的农活，换来的那些白糖放在什么地方了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那都是多久前的事了，现在到哪里找去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你找白糖干嘛？还有这些食材，你从哪弄到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等会，小福，你该不会这时候还有闲心做甜品吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，菲娜，你怎么了......你生气了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是有意背着你偷藏食材的，我只是想给大家一个惊喜。菲娜，你别生气，好不好？我做好了一定第一个让你尝尝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小福，你......算了，先把东西放下吧，现在不是做这些事的时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么好可是的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我还答应了别人，要做青草格子饼给她当谢礼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢礼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！有人帮我修好了守护铳！我得好好谢谢对方才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜，真的好神奇啊，当这把铳被修好，我握上它的那个瞬间，一切都感觉很不一样！我好像......好像天生就知道该怎么使用它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看！它变漂亮了好多，今后我们就可以一起用这把铳了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，小福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实没有那么在乎是否有自己的铳，也不在乎斯特凡诺爷爷总说的什么信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不在乎我从来没见过的拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲娜，你在说什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是个不合格的萨科塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我确实是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我在乎你，我在乎莱蒙德，我在乎斯特凡诺爷爷和杰拉尔德叔叔，还有克莱芒叔叔，妮娜婶婶，卡洛琳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在乎这里的所有人。我只有这一个家，只有这么点家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底在说什么啊，菲娜！我当然也在乎大家，我和你一样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你和我一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你知道莱蒙德他们过的是怎样的日子，你怎么还能在这样的时候有心情做这种玩笑一样的甜点，说那样天真的话？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时候我会觉得，自从拉特兰的人来了之后，你就有点变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？我没有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德尔菲娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_936_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小福，你的那把铳，是那个叫蕾缪安的拉特兰人帮你修好的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g7_chapel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教阁下，我按您的吩咐，让两位客人在修道院内自由行动了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样真的好吗？您......您看起来好像不太舒服，还是先休息一下吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克莱芒啊，我没事，不要担忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去敲钟，这周的布道提前到今天，去通知大伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰拉尔德，你们会来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉尔德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，斯特凡诺，我们还有不少准备要做，我不能保证有多少人会来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们真的要接受他们的条件吗？难道真的就要这么抛下其他人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要多问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，克莱芒，快去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......若信仰背叛了其自身，我也当，做出选择......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需为此忏悔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
